    {
        "content": "<p>Maybe this is wheel reinvention:  but today I set myself this learning exercise in Lean.</p>\n<p>Define a \"chain\" as an array, that preserves the invariant, that a certain given binary relation holds between all adjacent pairs.</p>\n<p>Here's what I got, after much labor with the unfamiliar ways of expressing the obvious.</p>\n<p>How can I make this more elegant or idiomatic?</p>\n<p>I did not try to import linarith.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/-- An Array of `Elem` preserving the invariant that</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  all adjacent pairs are related by `relation` -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Chain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">relation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">::</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Array</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">invariant</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">),</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">relation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Chain</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">push</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">relation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Chain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">relation</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elem</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hrel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">relation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">back</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Chain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">relation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Chain</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">push</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- show invariant preservation</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">intros</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">by_cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rename_i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hlast</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">-- use hrel for new last pair</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">elems</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"